# Copy to `.env` and fill in. `pylon dev` loads `.env` automatically.
#
# The studio boots with NO config — image + audio generations return a clearly
# labeled placeholder so the whole flow + live gallery work out of the box. Add
# an OpenAI key to produce real media. The key stays on the server (it's only
# read inside the generate action), never in the browser.

# ── OpenAI (optional — enables real image + audio generation) ────────────────
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# Override the default models if you like:
# OPENAI_IMAGE_MODEL=dall-e-3       # image generation (default: dall-e-3)
# OPENAI_TTS_MODEL=tts-1            # text-to-speech (default: tts-1)

# Video is a stubbed extension point — wire a provider (Replicate / fal.ai /
# Runway / Luma) in functions/generate.ts and read its key here.

# ── Site URL (optional) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SITE_URL=https://yourstudio.com
